    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「でも実際、どうやって新聞記事をいじくったんだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「末恐ろしいやつだな～、生徒会長めっちゃ焦ってたぞ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「可哀想になぁ、誰もここまでやれとは言ってないだろ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「おまえは知らないかもしれないけど、あのアホは円城寺のあとを継いで精一杯がんばってる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「ちょっとは、昔より楽しい君咲学院にしてくれてる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「いちおう応援してるんだぞ、わたしも。生徒会の、仲間だし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「本人に言うとつけあがるから、言わないけど……。おい、聞いてんのか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 71,
