    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「まぁ、いいけど。それより料理をしろ、ちゃちゃっと仕上げてくれたらいい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「わたしも料理本と睨めっこしながらつくったんだけど、どうにも上手にできなくてさ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「こんな感じで、いいのかな？　いちおう、シチューとハンバーグをつくってみたんだけど……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「ちなみに『食材』は、みなちゃんと時国が調達してくれたぞ～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「外部に協力者を用意しちゃいけない、ってルールはなかったからな～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「時国、探しものが得意なんだ。『食材』を素早くかき集めて、かなり早い段階でわたしに手渡してくれた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「大量すぎて、家庭科室まで運ぶのに苦労しちゃったぞ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「そんな『食材』を、どうにか料理してみたんだけど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「これ以上は、どうしたらいいかわからん。今のわたしじゃあ、これが精一杯だ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「これを活用して、おいしくしてくれたらいい。あれなら、いちから料理してくれてもいいけど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「おまえの手がくわわれば、わたしたちの優勝まちがいなしだぞ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-ghost",
    "pose": 0,
